# Company app store — static nginx serving HTML and APK downloads from store-artifacts/.
#
# Enable only after store.prabhixtechnologies.com resolves here. Caddy requests a certificate for
# every configured name; enabling this while DNS still points elsewhere produces failing ACME orders
# on a loop against a per-name weekly rate limit. Rollback: rename to .example and recreate caddy.

store.prabhixtechnologies.com {
	import security_headers
	reverse_proxy app-store:80
}
